  "2026-09-28T01:30:14.727Z","harness:codex","Hosted PR #1332 coverage shards all passed tests, but the merged gate reported 99.99% statements/lines with only src/mcp/server.ts:1063 uncovered. The mocked successful task can expose durable completed status before detached cleanup finishes; the test now observes stable completion after the executor receives another event-loop turn. Linked 9-test suite and full local 9383-test exact 100/100/100/100 coverage passed. Hosted exact-head coverage remains pending; local full static stopped only at host-sensitive CLI transport-floor timing."
  "2026-09-28T02:32:22.194Z","harness:codex","Hosted exact-head evidence: PR #1332 commit e3ad1955beba908a840748c4e96972a9f06ef8aa passed Gates (coverage) at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/36369408528/job/108763297565. This follows local linked MCP 9/9 and full 9384-test exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. Reopened to replace the earlier terminal evidence that accurately said hosted validation was pending at that time."
